abstract: >-
  MIRR is a safety-critical domain-specific language compiler that transforms
  temporal behavioral specifications into synthesizable SystemVerilog RTL,
  FIRRTL, R-SPU assembly, and S-expression intermediate representations.
  The project follows NASA Power-of-10 coding rules and includes formal
  verification via Rocq proofs.
